sequenceDiagram
  box System Value
    actor ReceptionClerk as 👤 医事課 受付担当
  end
  box System Boundary
    participant AppointmentScreen as 🖥️ Appointment Screen
  end
  box System
    participant System as 🧩 システム
    participant Appointment as 🗄️ Appointment
  end

  Note over ReceptionClerk,Appointment: ✅ Mark No Show
  ReceptionClerk->System: ✅ Mark No Show
  activate System
  System->>Appointment: update
  System-->>ReceptionClerk: 🖥️ Appointment Screen
  deactivate System
